<title>USA: Preliminary Canada livestock imports into the U.S..</title>
<headline>Preliminary Canada livestock imports into the U.S..</headline>
<text>
<p>Biweekly totals, as of February 1, 1997. Source: USDA-APHIS.</p>
<p>Cattle</p>
<p>Western State Totals			1997	 1996     Change</p>
<p>		01-Feb-97   03-Feb-96     YTD	  YTD	 YTD</p>
<p>Slaughter:    39,689	37,317     73,582     80,809     -8.9%</p>
<p>Feeder:	  7,342	20,072	9,866     24,842    -60.3%</p>
<p>Breeding:	  224	   301	  420	  892    -52.9%</p>
<p>Total:	  47,255	57,690     83,868    106,543    -21.3%</p>
<p>Northeast States Totals:</p>
<p>Cattle:	  8,121	 9,951     15,805     22,072    -28.4%</p>
<p>Total Canadian Cattle:</p>
<p>		  55,376	67,641     99,673    128,615    -22.5%</p>
<p>Hogs</p>
<p>Slaughter:    82,162	53,921    166,959    194,699    -14.2%</p>
<p>Feeder:	 31,990	27,208     61,255     64,307     -4.7%</p>
